{"seq":3,"slug":"design-thinking","title":"大学设计学 — 设计思维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/design-thinking","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学设计学-设计思维\">大学设计学 — 设计思维</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>设计思维 (Design Thinking) 是一种以人为中心的创新方法论，最初由 IDEO 和斯坦福 d.school 系统化推广。它不局限于视觉或产品设计领域，而是一套可以应用于商业战略、社会创新、技术研发等任何复杂问题的结构化创造过程。设计思维的核心在于&quot;先理解人，再定义问题，最后才寻找解决方案&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>英文名称</th>\n<th>核心活动</th>\n<th>关键产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共情</td>\n<td>Empathize</td>\n<td>观察、访谈、沉浸体验</td>\n<td>用户洞察、共情地图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定义</td>\n<td>Define</td>\n<td>综合分析、重构问题</td>\n<td>POV 陈述、HMW 问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构思</td>\n<td>Ideate</td>\n<td>头脑风暴、类比迁移</td>\n<td>概念方案集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原型</td>\n<td>Prototype</td>\n<td>快速建造、可视化</td>\n<td>低成本实物/数字原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>Test</td>\n<td>用户反馈、迭代学习</td>\n<td>验证结论、迭代方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"共情-理解真实需求\">共情：理解真实需求</h3><p>共情 (Empathize) 阶段的目标是跳出设计者自身的假设，进入用户的真实情境。关键方法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>影随观察 (Shadowing)</strong>：跟随用户完成日常任务，不打断、不引导，记录行为而非言语</li>\n<li><strong>深度访谈</strong>：采用半结构化访谈提纲，追问&quot;为什么&quot;至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> Whys 技术）</li>\n<li><strong>共情地图 (Empathy Map)</strong>：在四象限中记录用户&quot;说—想—做—感&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"quadrantChart\" data-source=\"quadrantChart&#10;    title 共情地图四象限&#10;    x-axis &quot;外在表现&quot; --&gt; &quot;内在世界&quot;&#10;    y-axis &quot;消极&quot; --&gt; &quot;积极&quot;&#10;    quadrant-1 &quot;想 Think&quot;&#10;    quadrant-2 &quot;说 Say&quot;&#10;    quadrant-3 &quot;做 Do&quot;&#10;    quadrant-4 &quot;感 Feel&quot;\">quadrantChart\n    title 共情地图四象限\n    x-axis \"外在表现\" --&gt; \"内在世界\"\n    y-axis \"消极\" --&gt; \"积极\"\n    quadrant-1 \"想 Think\"\n    quadrant-2 \"说 Say\"\n    quadrant-3 \"做 Do\"\n    quadrant-4 \"感 Feel\"</pre><p>极端用户 (Extreme Users) 往往能揭示主流用户隐藏的需求。例如研究厨房用具时，同时观察专业厨师和独臂残障用户，前者暴露效率瓶颈，后者暴露可用性边界。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定义-重构问题\">定义：重构问题</h3><p>从共情阶段收集的大量素材中提炼核心洞察，并将其转化为可操作的设计挑战。两个经典工具：</p>\n<p><strong>POV (Point of View) 陈述</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[用户] 需要 [需求] 因为 [洞察]</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>例如：&quot;通勤白领<strong>需要</strong>在地铁上高效阅读长文章，<strong>因为</strong>他们的注意力被频繁换乘打断，导致阅读进度难以维持。&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>HMW (How Might We) 问题</strong>：将 POV 转化为开放式设计问题</p>\n<ul>\n<li>太宽泛：❌ &quot;我们如何改善阅读体验？&quot;</li>\n<li>太狭窄：❌ &quot;我们如何在地铁上添加书签功能？&quot;</li>\n<li>恰当：✅ &quot;我们如何帮助通勤者在碎片时间中保持阅读连贯性？&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>HMW 的粒度决定了后续构思的发散空间。问题定义的质量可用信息熵来类比：当 HMW 范围过宽时信息熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 过高，团队发散失焦；过窄时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，解空间被过度约束：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = -\\sum_{i=1}^{n} p_i \\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想的 HMW 应让团队在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的中等区间高效探索。</p>\n<h3 id=\"构思-发散与收敛\">构思：发散与收敛</h3><p>构思阶段遵循&quot;先发散、后收敛&quot;的双钻石模型 (Double Diamond)。发散阶段的核心规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>延迟判断</strong> — 不在产生想法时评价好坏</li>\n<li><strong>追求数量</strong> — 数量产生质量，目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>+ 个想法</li>\n<li><strong>鼓励狂野</strong> — 不切实际的想法可能启发可行方案</li>\n<li><strong>搭建叠加</strong> — 在他人想法上&quot;Yes, and...&quot; 而非 &quot;No, but...&quot;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>常用发散方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经典头脑风暴</td>\n<td>自由联想 + 便签墙</td>\n<td>团队热身、广泛探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SCAMPER</td>\n<td>替代/合并/调整/修改/挪用/消除/重排</td>\n<td>基于现有方案改进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类比迁移</td>\n<td>从其他行业借用解决方案模式</td>\n<td>突破行业思维定式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反转假设</td>\n<td>列出所有假设并逐一反转</td>\n<td>打破隐性约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制关联</td>\n<td>随机词/图片 + 问题强制连接</td>\n<td>激发非线性联想</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>收敛阶段使用点投票 (Dot Voting)、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵（可行性 × 影响力）或 NUF 评分（New × Useful × Feasible，每项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分）筛选方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  subgraph 发散 Diverge&#10;    A[头脑风暴] --&gt; B[SCAMPER]&#10;    B --&gt; C[类比迁移]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 收敛 Converge&#10;    D[点投票] --&gt; E[2×2 矩阵]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Top 3 概念]&#10;  end&#10;  C --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n  subgraph 发散 Diverge\n    A[头脑风暴] --&gt; B[SCAMPER]\n    B --&gt; C[类比迁移]\n  end\n  subgraph 收敛 Converge\n    D[点投票] --&gt; E[2×2 矩阵]\n    E --&gt; F[Top 3 概念]\n  end\n  C --&gt; D</pre><h3 id=\"原型-快速具象化\">原型：快速具象化</h3><p>原型的目的不是展示完成度，而是&quot;用最低成本回答一个设计问题&quot;。速度比精度重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>角色扮演原型</strong>：团队成员扮演系统角色，模拟服务流程</li>\n<li><strong>纸板原型</strong>：用硬纸板、胶带搭建物理产品的尺寸感知模型</li>\n<li><strong>Wizard of Oz</strong>：用人力模拟尚未开发的技术后端，测试前端体验</li>\n<li><strong>数字原型</strong>：Figma 可点击原型，验证界面流程</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原型的分辨率 (Resolution) 应与待验证假设匹配。验证&quot;用户是否理解导航&quot;用纸质线框即可；验证&quot;动效是否减少焦虑&quot;则需高保真交互原型。</p>\n<p>投入—回报关系可用简化模型表示：当原型精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 超过验证所需阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后，额外投入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 带来的信息增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 急剧下降：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>when </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo>≫</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta I}{\\Delta C} \\to 0 \\quad \\text{when } q \\gg q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">when </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"测试-闭合反馈环\">测试：闭合反馈环</h3><p>测试阶段将原型交给目标用户，观察其真实反应。核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>展示，不讲解</strong> — 让用户自己探索原型，不提前解释功能</li>\n<li><strong>关注行为，不只言语</strong> — 用户说&quot;挺好的&quot;但操作犹豫 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 秒以上，说明存在可用性问题</li>\n<li><strong>记录意外</strong> — 用户的非预期行为往往是最有价值的发现</li>\n</ul>\n<p>测试后团队进入&quot;我们学到了什么&quot;的回顾：哪些假设被验证、哪些被推翻、下一轮迭代的焦点是什么。设计思维强调快速迭代：每轮原型+测试周期控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天，整个项目通常经历 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 轮迭代。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  A[共情] --&gt; B[定义] --&gt; C[构思] --&gt; D[原型] --&gt; E[测试]&#10;  E --&gt;|新洞察| A&#10;  E --&gt;|优化方向| C&#10;  E --&gt;|验证通过| F[方案落地]\">flowchart TB\n  A[共情] --&gt; B[定义] --&gt; C[构思] --&gt; D[原型] --&gt; E[测试]\n  E --&gt;|新洞察| A\n  E --&gt;|优化方向| C\n  E --&gt;|验证通过| F[方案落地]</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选择一个校园生活痛点（如食堂排队、快递取件），用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> Whys 追问法找到根因，并撰写一条 POV 陈述和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 条 HMW 问题。</li>\n<li>组织一次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的小组头脑风暴：选定一个 HMW 问题，遵循四条发散规则，目标产出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>+ 个想法，然后用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵收敛至 Top <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>为你的 Top <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 方案制作一个纸质原型（耗时不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟），然后找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 名非团队成员测试，记录他们的行为和困惑点。</li>\n<li>对比设计思维与精益创业 (Lean Startup) 的 Build-Measure-Learn 循环，讨论两者在&quot;验证假设&quot;环节的异同。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《创新自信力》(Creative Confidence)</strong> — Tom &amp; David Kelley，IDEO 创始人阐述设计思维的心智基础</li>\n<li><strong>《设计冲刺》(Sprint)</strong> — Jake Knapp，Google Ventures 五天设计冲刺方法</li>\n<li><strong>斯坦福 d.school 方法指南</strong> — 免费下载的设计思维工具包，含引导问题和模板</li>\n<li><strong>《Change by Design》</strong> — Tim Brown，从商业视角阐述设计思维如何驱动创新</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>设计思维的价值不在于五个阶段本身，而在于它建立的三种思维习惯：对用户的深度共情、对问题的重新定义、以及对不确定性的原型化探索。这三种习惯使设计师能够在模糊的早期阶段快速找到方向，在复杂的约束中创造出真正有意义的解决方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学设计学 — 设计思维","id":"大学设计学-设计思维"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"共情：理解真实需求","id":"共情-理解真实需求"},{"level":3,"text":"定义：重构问题","id":"定义-重构问题"},{"level":3,"text":"构思：发散与收敛","id":"构思-发散与收敛"},{"level":3,"text":"原型：快速具象化","id":"原型-快速具象化"},{"level":3,"text":"测试：闭合反馈环","id":"测试-闭合反馈环"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学设计学 — 用户体验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/product-design/user-experience"},"next":{"title":"室内设计原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/environmental-design/interior-design"}}